{"lyrics":"[00:00.72](D-D-Daytrip Took It To Ten, Hey)\n[00:11.20]Fine\n[00:11.96]Say they wanna read my mind, they really wanna read my mind\n[00:16.90]Telling you right now, all you'll find Is a lost soul, rich and blind\n[00:23.78]They say they wanna read my mind, do you really wanna read my mind?\n[00:29.04]I promise, all that you will find Is a lost soul, rich and blind\n[00:36.56]I know I have a purpose, but I don't see the purpose\n[00:39.52]They tell me the death of me gon' be the Perkys\n[00:42.60]I know they laced pills, I bought them on purpose\n[00:45.76]Life's unreal and death's uncertain\n[00:48.58]It's funny how the blessed ones had the most curses\n[00:51.38]Heart falling to the floor if we lose another person\n[00:54.70]Take three more, I swear it's worth it but it ain't no world tour if I'm laying in a hearse\n[01:00.50]I remember losing lil' bro, he laying in the dirt\n[01:03.36]Now I'm bound to drop a tear or two on every single verse\n[01:06.42]Good terms, bad terms, when they die, it's the worst\n[01:09.34]Sometimes when I'm high, I feel high in reverse\n[01:12.48]I ain't going out like that, you fuck with me, you get the work\n[01:15.28]You ain't gon' see me in no wooden box, I'm gonna shoot 'em first\n[01:18.32]I promise y'all I'm finna touch the world, yeah, I'ma touch the Earth\n[01:21.08]But hold on, your girl on my line, I think I may just fuck her first\n[01:24.36]Yeah, gotta have some crude humor just to keep a good vibe going, keep the song grooving\n[01:29.60]So all my money longer, shout out bro Uzi\n[01:32.60]Keep my eyes in the sky 'cause that's where I'm moving\n[01:35.98]Say they wanna read my mind, they really wanna read my mind\n[01:40.90]Telling you right now, all you'll find Is a lost soul, rich and blind\n[01:47.78]They say they wanna read my mind, do you really wanna read my mind?\n[01:53.08]I promise, all that you will find Is a lost soul, rich and blind\n[02:02.64]Is a lost soul, rich and blind, blind, blind, blind\n[02:11.98]This is dedicated to you if you felt the lowest of the low\n[02:15.40]I know how it feels, you don't wanna struggle anymore\n[02:18.44]Used to ball hard, ain't no triple-doubles anymore\n[02:21.36]Bitch, I'm talking 'bout my tears, turned around and faced my fears\n[02:24.44]I haven't felt this low in years, we die in three like musketeers\n[02:27.18]Ain't too many real niggas left in here, R.I.P. to all my peers\n[02:30.32]Smoking loud pack, what you say? I can't hear but I still hear the fallen ones in my ears\n[02:37.08]Why, why do we live to die, die?\n[02:41.28]When it's my time, time, time I'll leave behind my and my thirteen reasons why\n[02:47.92]Say they wanna read my mind, they really wanna read my mind\n[02:52.88]Telling you right now, all you'll find Is a lost soul, rich and blind\n[02:59.78]They say they wanna read my mind, do you really wanna read my mind?\n[03:05.10]I promise, all that you will find Is a lost soul, rich and blind\n[03:14.60]Is a lost soul, rich and blind, blind, blind, blind\n[03:30.00](D-D-Daytrip Took It To Ten, Hey)","words":[[0.72,4.74,"(D-D-Daytrip"],[7.26,9.06,"Took"],[9.12,9.7,"It"],[9.9,10.4,"To"],[10.44,10.9,"Ten,"],[10.94,10.98,"Hey)"],[11.2,11.68,"Fine"],[11.96,12.1,"Say"],[12.18,12.26,"they"],[12.38,12.58,"wanna"],[12.76,13.02,"read"],[13.12,13.34,"my"],[13.48,13.88,"mind,"],[14.8,14.88,"they"],[15.0,15.26,"really"],[15.38,15.58,"wanna"],[15.74,16.02,"read"],[16.12,16.34,"my"],[16.46,16.84,"mind"],[16.9,17.22,"Telling"],[17.26,17.36,"you"],[17.6,17.9,"right"],[18.0,18.32,"now,"],[18.84,19.02,"all"],[19.1,19.36,"you'll"],[19.46,20.06,"find"],[20.66,20.76,"Is"],[20.84,20.84,"a"],[20.98,21.24,"lost"],[21.34,21.62,"soul,"],[21.76,22.1,"rich"],[22.2,22.38,"and"],[22.46,22.94,"blind"],[23.78,23.88,"They"],[23.98,24.1,"say"],[24.18,24.24,"they"],[24.38,24.58,"wanna"],[24.74,25.0,"read"],[25.12,25.34,"my"],[25.48,25.9,"mind,"],[26.62,26.68,"do"],[26.82,26.88,"you"],[27.0,27.26,"really"],[27.38,27.58,"wanna"],[27.74,28.02,"rea